National Vulnerability Database (NVD) CPE Dictionary

pkg/cpe/cpemap.json.gz is generated from the NVD CPE dictionary bulk feed:

    https://nvd.nist.gov/feeds/json/cpe/2.0/nvdcpe-2.0.tar.gz

It is a distillation of that dictionary's live application entries into a
product-to-vendor-to-version mapping. The snapshot date of the feed it was
generated from is recorded in pkg/cpe/snapshot_gen.go as NVDSnapshot, and the
file is regenerated with `go generate ./pkg/cpe/...`.

NVD data is produced by the National Institute of Standards and Technology
(NIST), an agency of the United States government. As a work of the U.S.
Government it is in the public domain and carries no redistribution
restriction. NIST does not endorse any product or service that uses this data.
